/* v254：遊々亭の検索ページを読む（カードごとに 番号・レアリティ・名前・値段・在庫）。売り切れ（在庫 ×）は外す */
function zYytParse_(html) {
  const out = [], parts = String(html || '').split(/<div class="card-product position-relative/);
  for (let i = 1; i < parts.length; i++) {
    const b = parts[i].slice(0, 6000);
    if (/^[^"]*sold-out/.test(b)) continue;
    const href = (b.match(/href="(https:\/\/yuyu-tei\.jp\/sell\/poc\/card\/([^\/"]+)\/(\d+))"/) || []);
    const alt = (b.match(/alt="([^"]+)" class="card/) || [])[1] || '';
    const pr = (b.match(/>\s*([\d,]+)\s*円\s*<\/strong>/) || [])[1];
    const zk = ((b.match(/在庫\s*:\s*([^<]+)</) || [])[1] || '').trim();
    const img = (b.match(/src="(https:\/\/card\.yuyu-tei\.jp\/poc\/[^"]+\.jpg)"/) || [])[1] || '';
    if (!href[1] || !alt || !pr || /×/.test(zk)) continue;
    out.push({ id: 'yyt-' + href[2] + '-' + href[3], url: href[1], title: 'ポケモンカード ' + alt,   // シリーズの記号（sv08a など）は eBay の書き方（SV8a）と違うので入れない
 price: Number(pr.replace(/,/g, '')), images: img ? [img] : [], stock: zk, freeShip: false });
  }
  return out;
}


